<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-25T06:31:57.762Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 06:31:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces killed a disabled Syrian man in the Daraa buffer zone, deployed rooftop snipers in southern Syria and detained three people in Quneitra, while Syrian security officers were killed in a raid on an ISIL cell near Damascus. Protesters across Syria rallied against repeated Israeli incursions and blocked the Damascus-Suwayda road demanding detainee releases, with outlaw groups closing the highway. An arms depot explosion in Syria left 37 dead. 2732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNRzFxMmE4dWx3blk3Yy1MSGJTOXI4NC1URUM3OFBTdzdKUGRWWWRLLXl2bXJfNmoxLXJ6dmN3RFdmU0pRanZsN3dMXzZWaDRpbFhhdm1wanFDQ2FkdUxGcFoyaW41MjkwMER1RDVfRF9MLTgxcTlCMl9tTGgzOFNWV2NublFLUkM2VjBDU3A5Wm9SdVZfeEFyQlRjc09yc0pocTF1emZPMlJ2dVUzRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSC1nQXdzUDZqdGNJdUZhVm5yVlhmRzVGeFlNTk5Ubkc3VmJCV3FjaHdsSEVnRDIta2oxR3VpNWo2LURaYTF1dFBhOGdFbmZEYktoNmZ6cWxLaDM3ZER3M0xkazExTC1uMFRFc1lSUmk5bWNYYmNoQ3kzTXY3bThBaWNpbG9WMFlfVll3eGdtMTdNLUtSUnhINFFkOV9qdkV4UWZmTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/22/two-syrian-security-officers-killed-in-raid-on-isil-cell-near-damascus&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news-analysis/2026/10/22/ilhan-omar-home-raid-haines-attack-inside-rise-in-violence-on-officials&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPTmRkWmpfdGtZeGhnNkl3cnA5X1VMUnlJR3NMbVFGTWtQc2RJQ24wNUFFU3NFbWppczJKUEdoQUFkR1ZBeGotelFmMUJPNndveENhMGhaZFVOcFJucjJMeHQzaDhyLVlQUlNvOVUtbGZDNnhfRFp4cWdWZ21xVHJVRnFtTnlmZWEtQzVIOEE0SjFaV1h3MmZweTBuc1Z1UEh0S3BvTWdDZF9EdktwbnNWcjJSS1ZuM2JS?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Ara